# Shared intelligent-testing workflow

- Read and obey `AGENTS.md`. It is the cross-tool source of truth for workflow gates, directories, stable IDs, and validation.
- Reuse the project Skills under `.agents/skills/`; do not create Cursor-only copies.
- Use `/requirements-to-spec`, `/spec-to-test-points`, and `/test-points-to-casebook` in Cursor Agent mode.
- If a Skill is not present in the current chat, read its `.agents/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md` file explicitly before acting.
- Never generate test points or formal cases from an unapproved Spec.
- Preserve existing REQ, TP, and TC IDs, keep traceability in `traceability.yaml`, and run the repository validator before handoff.
